// One frame: render the scene at tick t (see scene/render), then poll one
// input event. glwin_poll returns -2 when the window (or GFX_MAX_FRAMES) wants
// to close, -1 for no event, or a key code; idstd's inp_live turns that into a
// keep-running flag (Esc or q also quit).

frame(int tick) {
  render(tick);
  int input_event = glwin_poll();
} return int input_event;
given scene_initialize (0):(-1)
given scene_initialize (50):(-1)
